    "## 2. Two common strategies\n",
    "\n",
    "There are usually two ways to deal with bad input or invalid situations:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. **Defensive programming**: check values before doing the operation  \n",
    "2. **Exception handling**: let Python detect the problem, then catch the exception\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "97861186",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "OKWNGCrPMExN"
   },
   "source": [
    "## 2 options\n",
    "1. defensive programming (aka check the values )\n",
    "2. handling the error (catching the error)"
   ]
  },
