   "id": "74ea4e05",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### A very small `try` / `except` example\n",
    "\n",
    "This is the simplest pattern:\n",
    "\n",
    "- put risky code inside `try`\n",
    "- handle the error inside `except`\n",
    "- keep the program from crashing\n"
   ]
