   "source": [
    "## 10. `else` and `finally`\n",
    "\n",
    "In a `try` statement:\n",
    "\n",
    "- `except` runs only if an exception occurs\n",
    "- `else` runs only if no exception occurs\n",
    "- `finally` runs **every time**\n",
    "\n",
    "`finally` is commonly used for cleanup actions.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "8e18e017",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
